SELECT DISTINCT ?item ?itemLabel ?legislature ?legislatureLabel ?position ?positiontype ?electoraldistrict ?electoraldistrictLabel ?edtype ?starttime ?endtime ?parliametarygroup ?fbid WHERE { 
    VALUES ?member {wd:Q42509248} .
    ?node ps:P39 ?member .
    ?item p:P39 ?node .
    MINUS {?item wdt:P570 [] }
    MINUS {?node pq:P582 [] }
    OPTIONAL { ?node pq:P4100 ?parliametarygroup }
    OPTIONAL { ?node pq:P580 ?starttime }
    OPTIONAL { ?node pq:P768 ?electoraldistrict .
      OPTIONAL { ?electoraldistrict wdt:P31 ?edtype }
    }
    OPTIONAL { ?node pq:P582 ?endtime }
    ?node ps:P39 ?position .
    ?position wdt:P31 ?positiontype .
    OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P2013 ?fbid }
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "[AUTO_LANGUAGE],en". }
}
ORDER BY ?item
